@startuml
title Admin User - Get User By Id (GET /api/admin/users/{userId})
hide footbox
actor Client
participant UserController
participant AppUserService
participant AppUserRepository
participant GlobalExceptionHandler as GEH

Client -> UserController: GET /api/admin/users/{userId}
note right of Client: Already authenticated by JwtAuthenticationFilter\nSecurityConfig: /api/admin/** requires role ADMIN

UserController -> AppUserService: getUserById(userId)

AppUserService -> AppUserService: findUserOrThrow(userId)
AppUserService -> AppUserRepository: findById(userId)
AppUserRepository --> AppUserService: Optional<AppUser>

alt Optional is empty (user not found)
    AppUserService --> UserController: throw ResourceNotFoundException
    UserController --> GEH: ResourceNotFoundException
    GEH --> Client: 404 Not Found
else User found
    AppUserService -> AppUserService: UserResponse.from(user)
    AppUserService --> UserController: UserResponse
    UserController --> Client: 200 OK (UserResponse)
end
@enduml